s "question-c10a018a-81ad-5ca3-aa1e-62d5a7f08abd"] ["question-47bf2910-5b88-5885-9dd5-4d92d20a68db" :question/id #uuid "47bf2910-5b88-5885-9dd5-4d92d20a68db"] ["question-47bf2910-5b88-5885-9dd5-4d92d20a68db" :question/math-academy-id "q-175515"] ["question-47bf2910-5b88-5885-9dd5-4d92d20a68db" :question/problem "Find the truth set of $¬P(x)$ given the following predicate defined over the universal set $R:$\n\n$\\,$ $P(x):$ $3x+2>8$"] ["question-47bf2910-5b88-5885-9dd5-4d92d20a68db" :question/worked-solution "The truth set of $¬P(x)$ is the *complement* of the truth set of $P(x):$\n\n$$\n{T}_{¬P}={\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\n$$\n\nTo find the the truth set of $P(x),$ we solve the inequality:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+2 & >8 \\\\ 3x & >6 \\\\ x & >2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the truth set of $P(x)$ is\n${T}_{P}=(2,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{¬P} & ={\\overset{―}{T}}_{P} \\\\  & =\\overset{―}{(2,\\infty )} \\\\  & =(-\\infty ,2].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-47bf2910-5b88-5885-9dd5-4d92d20a68db" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-7b433756-abce-5e65-9a41-9ca1f36d94b8" :answer-field/id #uuid "7b433756-abce-5e65-9a41-9ca1f36d94b8"] ["answer-99773e8e-1dd3-55c6-9ec4-2b0c92faccb1" :answer/id #uuid "99773e8e-1dd3-55c6-9ec4-2b0c92faccb1"] ["answer-99773e8e-1dd3-55c6-9ec4-2b0c92faccb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-99773e8e-1dd3-55c6-9ec4-2b0c92faccb1" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,2)"] ["answer-a96a2954-c618-5c1d-8981-c4359202a3ac" :answer/id #uuid "a96a2954-c618-5c1d-8981-c4359202a3ac"] ["answer-a96a2954-c618-5c1d-8981-c4359202a3ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a96a2954-c618-5c1d-8981-c4359202a3ac" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,2]"] ["answer-7a42e16e-4b1a-5fa2-94ad-3880067141ba" :answer/id #uuid "7a42e16e-4b1a-5fa2-94ad-3880067141ba"] ["answer-7a42e16e-4b1a-5fa2-94ad-3880067141ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7a42e16e-4b1a-5fa2-94ad-3880067141ba" :answer/value "(2,\\infty )"] ["answer-2548